# NOXHEIM environment contract

Copy to `.env.local` for local app development. **No real secrets in this file.**

Labels: **required** / **optional** · **browser-safe** / **server-only** / **CI-only**

## Browser-safe (required for the app)

```
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
```

`NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` is accepted as a fallback for the publishable key.

Local default URL is `http://127.0.0.1:54321` after `npx supabase start`.

## Server-only (required in production)

```
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
CRON_SECRET=
```

`SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` must never be `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`. Used by monitor jobs and `/internal/operations`.

`CRON_SECRET` authorizes `GET/POST /api/internal/monitor/daily` and `/weekly` (`Authorization: Bearer` or `x-cron-secret`).

## Server-only email (required for sending; app runs without them)

```
RESEND_API_KEY=
INVITE_FROM_EMAIL=
NOTIFICATION_FROM_EMAIL=
```

- Invite emails use `INVITE_FROM_EMAIL`.
- Impact + weekly digest use `NOTIFICATION_FROM_EMAIL`, then fall back to `INVITE_FROM_EMAIL`.
- Missing keys: invites still create a copyable link; monitor records `not_configured` rather than claiming sent.

## Site URL (optional; recommended in production)

```
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.noxheim.com
```

Used for invite links and email CTAs. Falls back to Vercel URL or `https://www.noxheim.com`.

## Official ingest — local

No extra flags. `npm run dev:ingest-ei-nup` targets local Supabase only.

## Official ingest — Design Partner Cloud / GitHub Actions (CI-only + server)

```
NOXHEIM_ALLOW_REMOTE_INGEST=true
NOXHEIM_REMOTE_PROJECT_REF=krgzpgqmnzljwlwptmcn
NOXHEIM_SCHEDULED_INGEST=true
MONITOR_TRIGGER=scheduled
INGEST_FORCE=false
SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN=
SUPABASE_DB_PASSWORD=
```

`NOXHEIM_SCHEDULED_INGEST` or `GITHUB_ACTIONS=true` is required for `scripts/scheduled-official-ingest.mjs`.
`INGEST_FORCE=true` or `--force` makes the run `manual` (operator fallback).

Never accept user-supplied ingest URLs.

## Operator UI (optional, server-only)

```
OPERATOR_EMAILS=ops@example.com
OPERATOR_USER_IDS=
```

Comma-separated. Empty = nobody can open `/internal/operations`. Not a client-side `isAdmin` flag.

## Observability (optional, server-only)

```
SENTRY_DSN=
SENTRY_ENABLED=true
```

If unset, structured JSON logs (`console.info` / `console.error`) are the fallback. Never log document bytes, invite tokens, or service keys.

## E2E / integration (CI-only, optional)

```
E2E_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000
E2E_EMAIL=
E2E_PASSWORD=
```

`npm run test:integration` refuses the Design Partner Cloud project ref and requires local Docker + `npx supabase start`.
`npm run test:e2e` skips if `E2E_EMAIL` / `E2E_PASSWORD` are unset.

## Sales demo reset (CI/operator only)

```
NOXHEIM_ALLOW_REMOTE_DEMO_SEED=true
NOXHEIM_REMOTE_PROJECT_REF=krgzpgqmnzljwlwptmcn
```

Allowlisted demo organisation only. Not a customer backup tool.
